# scripts/check_static.py runs this (#342). Left out, each for a reason:
#  - bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: the parameter order of AGENT.md §1
#    (lengths before arrays) produces adjacent size_t on purpose; 213 findings,
#    none a bug.
#  - bugprone-multi-level-implicit-pointer-conversion: safe_free takes void **
#    by design.
#  - DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling: asks for C11 Annex K, which no toolchain
#    here ships; it flags every fprintf.
#  - optin.performance.Padding: field order in the session and state structs
#    follows access patterns, not size.
Checks: >-
  -*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  bugprone-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-multi-level-implicit-pointer-conversion,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.performance.Padding
HeaderFilterRegex: '(src|include)/.*'
